    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n56250" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καύσ-τειρᾰ</span></b> , fem. of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καυστήρ</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>burning hot, raging</i>, only as Adj.in gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μάχης καυστείρης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					4.342
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				12.316
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καυ στείρης . . καμίνου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nic.
					<u>Th.</u>
					924
				</span></i>
			: accented <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καυστειρῆς</span> in good
			codd. of <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> and <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
			</span></i>:—later in the form <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καυστηρός</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>H.</u>
				2.509
			</span></i>, v.l. in Nic.l.c., cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				493.44
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
